## Raw Source Coverage

The parser preserves the full original LOLBAS YAML object in `obj.raw`. This template intentionally avoids rendering the full raw object because plain Jinja2 does not include a YAML serialization filter by default.

For debugging, inspect `obj.raw` in the build logs or add a project-specific YAML serialization filter in the renderer.
